#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "The collector re-reads the configuration every round, changes apply automatically within a minute."
msgstr "采集器每轮都会重新读取配置，更改会在一分钟内自动生效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "常规设置"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Enable collector"
msgstr "启用采集器"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Ping interval (seconds)"
msgstr "Ping 间隔（秒）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Rounds start aligned to full minutes. 60 = one round per minute, larger values sample less often."
msgstr "采集轮按整分钟对齐开始。60 表示每分钟一轮，更大的值表示更低的采样频率。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Pings per round"
msgstr "每轮 Ping 次数"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Ping timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Ping 超时（秒）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Packet size (bytes)"
msgstr "数据包大小（字节）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Data directory"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Where the binary data files are stored. A tmpfs path (default /tmp/ipping-data) avoids flash wear but loses data on reboot. Point this to persistent storage (e.g. /etc/ipping-data or a USB mount) to keep history, at the cost of flash writes."
msgstr "二进制数据文件的存储位置。默认 /tmp/ipping-data（内存盘）可避免闪存磨损，但重启后数据丢失；指向持久存储（如 /etc/ipping-data 或 U 盘挂载点）可保留历史数据，但会产生闪存写入。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Minute data retention (minutes)"
msgstr "分钟数据保留时长（分钟）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "10080 = 7 days. Roughly 11 KiB per target per day."
msgstr "10080 = 7 天。每个目标每天约 11 KiB。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Hourly data retention (hours)"
msgstr "小时数据保留时长（小时）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "8760 = 365 days. Roughly 7.3 KiB per target per month."
msgstr "8760 = 365 天。每个目标每月约 7.3 KiB。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Ping Targets"
msgstr "Ping 目标"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/ipping/overview.js
msgid "Data files are kept per target name (or host). Renaming a target starts a new data set."
msgstr "数据文件按目标名称（或主机）保存。修改目标名称将开始新的数据集。"

